        "semanticLevel": "detail",
        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style='width:100%;height:100%;overflow:auto;box-sizing:border-box;container-type:inline-size;background:#f4f0e6;font-family:Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Book Antiqua,Georgia,serif;color:#272727'><div style='box-sizing:border-box;max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 clamp(20px,5cqw,40px) 64px'><div style='padding-top:32px'><header data-role='masthead'><div style='padding:10px 0;border-top:6px solid #a63129;border-bottom:1px solid #272727;font:800 12px/16px system-ui;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#a63129'>START HERE</div><h1 style='margin:40px 0 0;font:850 clamp(36px,9.5cqw,72px)/.98 system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.055em;text-wrap:balance;color:#272727'>Your first graph</h1><p style='margin:18px 0 0;max-width:36ch;font:400 clamp(20px,3.6cqw,26px)/1.4 Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Book Antiqua,Georgia,serif;color:#514b43'>Nodes, and how they relate. This one is yours: change anything.</p></header></div><div style='padding-top:48px'><section data-role='section'><h2 style='margin:0 0 14px;font:800 12px/16px system-ui;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#a63129'>What to do first</h2><p style='margin:0 0 14px;max-width:60ch;font:400 19px/1.6 Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Book Antiqua,Georgia,serif;color:#37342f'><span style='float:left;padding:6px 10px 0 0;font:500 68px/54px Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Book Antiqua,Georgia,serif;color:#272727'>A</span>dd a node with the plus in the toolbar, then drag from a handle on one node to another. Right-click for Properties.</p></section></div><div style='padding-top:40px'><div style='display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:stretch;gap:28px 32px'><div style='flex:1 1 190px;min-width:0'><section data-role='route' data-prominence='primary' style='height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding-top:12px;border-top:3px solid #a63129'><h2 style='margin:0 0 8px;font:750 26px/1.1 system-ui;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:#272727'>Start here</h2><p style='margin:0 0 10px;font:400 14px/1.55 system-ui;color:#514b43'>A short walk through making a graph.</p><a data-role='route-link' href='tlz://twilite.zone/tutorial/root.node' style='margin-top:auto;font:700 13px/20px system-ui;text-decoration:none;color:#a63129'>Open the tutorial →</a></section></div><div style='flex:1 1 190px;min-width:0'><section data-role='route' data-prominence='secondary' style='height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid #272727'><h2 style='margin:0 0 8px;font:750 22px/1.1 system-ui;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:#272727'>What a graph is</h2><p style='margin:0 0 10px;font:400 14px/1.55 system-ui;color:#514b43'>A node graph in plain words: ideas, and the relationships between them.</p><a data-role='route-link' href='tlz://twilite.zone/library/documentation/what-is-a-graph/root.node' style='margin-top:auto;font:700 13px/20px system-ui;text-decoration:none;color:#514b43'>Read about it →</a></section></div><div style='flex:1 1 190px;min-width:0'><section data-role='route' data-prominence='secondary' style='height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid #272727'><h2 style='margin:0 0 8px;font:750 22px/1.1 system-ui;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:#272727'>The Twilite Zone</h2><p style='margin:0 0 10px;font:400 14px/1.55 system-ui;color:#514b43'>Where graphs like this one live, and how they link.</p><a data-role='route-link' href='tlz://twilite.zone/root.node' style='margin-top:auto;font:700 13px/20px system-ui;text-decoration:none;color:#514b43'>Open the Zone →</a></section></div></div></div><div style='padding-top:48px'><section data-role='section'><h2 style='margin:0 0 14px;font:800 12px/16px system-ui;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#a63129'>The root</h2><p style='margin:0 0 14px;max-width:60ch;font:400 19px/1.6 Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Book Antiqua,Georgia,serif;color:#37342f'>Your graph&#39;s name and description live here, and every other part connects to it.</p></section></div><div style='padding-top:48px'><section data-role='section'><h2 style='margin:0 0 14px;font:800 12px/16px system-ui;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#a63129'>The Detail view</h2><p style='margin:0 0 14px;max-width:60ch;font:400 19px/1.6 Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Book Antiqua,Georgia,serif;color:#37342f'>The page you see when you open the graph.</p></section></div><div style='padding-top:48px'><section data-role='section'><h2 style='margin:0 0 14px;font:800 12px/16px system-ui;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#a63129'>The Summary view</h2><p style='margin:0 0 14px;max-width:60ch;font:400 19px/1.6 Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Book Antiqua,Georgia,serif;color:#37342f'>The same page as a card, for when the graph is seen smaller.</p></section></div><div style='padding-top:48px'><section data-role='section'><h2 style='margin:0 0 14px;font:800 12px/16px system-ui;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#a63129'>The glyph</h2><p style='margin:0 0 14px;max-width:60ch;font:400 19px/1.6 Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Book Antiqua,Georgia,serif;color:#37342f'>The mark that stands for the graph when it is seen smallest.</p></section></div><div style='padding-top:48px'><section data-role='section'><h2 style='margin:0 0 14px;font:800 12px/16px system-ui;letter-spacing:.18em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#a63129'>The environment</h2><p style='margin:0 0 14px;max-width:60ch;font:400 19px/1.6 Newsreader,Iowan Old Style,Palatino Linotype,Book Antiqua,Georgia,serif;color:#37342f'>The room your work sits in. This poster is it; delete it and the graph stands on plain graph paper.</p></section></div><div style='padding-top:40px'><div style='display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:stretch;gap:28px 32px'><div style='flex:1 1 190px;min-width:0'><section data-role='route' data-prominence='secondary' style='height:100%;box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;flex-direction:column;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid #272727'><h2 style='margin:0 0 8px;font:750 22px/1.1 system-ui;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:#272727'>The Library</h2><p style='margin:0 0 10px;font:400 14px/1.55 system-ui;color:#514b43'>What the Twilite Zone publishes, by shelf.</p><a data-role='route-link' href='tlz://twilite.zone/library/root.node' style='margin-top:auto;font:700 13px/20px system-ui;text-decoration:none;color:#514b43'>Open the library →</a></section></div></div></div></div></div>"
