          }
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style='container-type:inline-size;width:100%;height:100%'><div style='position:relative;box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:100%;overflow:hidden;background-color:#292923;background-image:linear-gradient(color-mix(in srgb,#665f56 26%,transparent) 0.12cqw,transparent 0.12cqw),linear-gradient(90deg,color-mix(in srgb,#665f56 26%,transparent) 0.12cqw,transparent 0.12cqw),linear-gradient(color-mix(in srgb,#665f56 12%,transparent) 0.08cqw,transparent 0.08cqw),linear-gradient(90deg,color-mix(in srgb,#665f56 12%,transparent) 0.08cqw,transparent 0.08cqw);background-size:10cqw 10cqw,10cqw 10cqw,2cqw 2cqw,2cqw 2cqw;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Segoe UI,Helvetica Neue,Arial,sans-serif;color:#ffffff'><div style='position:absolute;left:4cqw;top:3.4cqw;font:800 1.5cqw/1.2 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#e5a83e'>Environment</div><div style='position:absolute;left:4cqw;right:4cqw;top:6.2cqw;font:800 6.6cqw/.9 system-ui,sans-serif;letter-spacing:-.03em;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis'>Your first graph</div><div style='position:absolute;left:4cqw;right:4cqw;top:14.34cqw;font:400 2.5cqw/1.3 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#f4f0e6;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis'>Nodes, and how they relate. This one is yours: change anything.</div><div style='position:absolute;left:4cqw;top:23.200000000000003cqw;font:400 1.7cqw/1 ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;color:#e5a83e'>This is the environment: the room your graph sits in.</div><div style='position:absolute;left:4%;top:27.6%;right:4%;bottom:8.9%;box-sizing:border-box;border-radius:2cqw;background:color-mix(in srgb,#e5a83e 7%,#292923);border:.3cqw solid color-mix(in srgb,#e5a83e 28%,#292923)'></div><div style='position:absolute;left:4cqw;right:4cqw;bottom:2.4cqw;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.7cqw 2.4cqw;font:700 1.4cqw/1.25 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;color:#e5a83e'></div><div style='position:absolute;right:4cqw;top:3cqw;display:flex;gap:2.2cqw;font:700 1.9cqw/1.2 Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;white-space:nowrap'><a href='tlz://twilite.zone/tutorial/root.node' style='color:#e5a83e;text-decoration:none'>Start here →</a><a href='tlz://twilite.zone/library/documentation/what-is-a-graph/root.node' style='color:#e5a83e;text-decoration:none'>What a graph is →</a><a href='tlz://twilite.zone/root.node' style='color:#e5a83e;text-decoration:none'>The Twilite Zone →</a></div></div></div>"
        },
        "memo": "The environment: the room the graph's work sits in. This poster teaches; delete it and the graph stands on plain graph paper."
      }
    },
